<!DOCTYPE qhelp SYSTEM "qhelp.dtd">
<qhelp>
  <overview>
    <p>
      This repository keeps a small set of workflow invariants around public
      release publication and runner safety. Violating those invariants can make
      release artifacts or workflow logs harder to trust.
    </p>
  </overview>
  <recommendation>
    <p>
      Keep official release publication downstream of the Rust or rusty-v8 tag
      validation jobs, keep public workflows on GitHub-hosted runners, and use
      private deployment infrastructure for host-local operations.
    </p>
  </recommendation>
</qhelp>
